{"The folder with your own game folders (exefs/romfs) of The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild for Nintendo Switch, version 1.0.0. The game isn't included with BOTWRecompAndroid.",
 "包含你自己的 Nintendo Switch 版《塞尔达传说 旷野之息》1.0.0 版本游戏文件夹（exefs/romfs）的文件夹。BOTWRecompAndroid 不包含游戏本身。"},
{"The folder with your own game folders (exefs/romfs) of The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild for Nintendo Switch: version 1.0.0, 1.6.0 or 1.8.2 (the one in Brazilian Portuguese). The version is told from the files, and each one is set up in a place of its own, beside the others. The game isn't included with BOTWRecompAndroid.",
 "包含你自己的 Nintendo Switch 版《塞尔达传说 旷野之息》游戏文件夹（exefs/romfs）的文件夹：版本 1.0.0、1.6.0 或 1.8.2（含巴西葡萄牙语的那个）。版本会根据文件识别，每个版本都会在各自的位置并排设置。BOTWRecompAndroid 不包含游戏本身。"},
{"The game code didn't build",
 "游戏代码未能编译"},
{"The game code needs building",
 "需要编译游戏代码"},
{"The game data (romfs) and the game code (exefs) are from different versions. Choose a folder where both come from the same version.",
 "游戏数据（romfs）和游戏代码（exefs）来自不同版本。请选择两者来自同一版本的文件夹。"},
{"The game files are already here: this builds the game code from them again, as BOTWRecompAndroid needs after an update. It may take a while.",
 "游戏文件已在这里：这会用它们重新编译游戏代码，这是 BOTWRecompAndroid 更新后需要的。可能需要一些时间。"},
{"The game runs on the system's driver, lighting included. On Adreno GPUs, Mesa's Turnip driver runs it faster: choose a Turnip driver package (.zip, as for adrenotools).",
 "游戏使用系统驱动运行，包括光照。在 Adreno GPU 上，Mesa 的 Turnip 驱动运行得更快：请选择一个 Turnip 驱动包（.zip，和 adrenotools 用的一样）。"},
{"The game's first release, without updates.",
 "游戏的首个版本，不含更新。"},
{"The game's last update, the only one in Brazilian Portuguese. 60 fps and widescreen (Video settings) work in this one.",
 "游戏的最后一次更新，也是唯一含巴西葡萄牙语的版本。60 fps 和宽屏（视频设置）在此版本中可用。"},
{"The phone's gyroscope - or a controller's that has one - aims the bow and the Sheikah Slate's camera and tilts the shrines' motion puzzles, as the Switch's motion controls do. The game's own options can turn motion aiming off.",
 "手机的陀螺仪（或带陀螺仪的手柄）可以瞄准弓和希卡石板的相机，并倾斜神庙中的体感谜题，就像 Switch 的体感操作。游戏自身的选项可以关闭体感瞄准。"},
{"The game's reverb effect (echo in caves and big rooms).",
 "游戏的混响效果（洞穴和大房间里的回声）。"},
{"The game's text language, as its own system setting. Applies when the game restarts: Quit -> Title screen, then Play.",
 "游戏文字的语言，相当于游戏自己的系统设置。游戏重新启动后生效：退出 -> 回到开始界面，然后开始游戏。"},
{"The game's volume. 100% is the game's own level; above it, louder.",
 "游戏音量。100% 是游戏原本的音量；高于它会更响。"},
{"the system's driver",
 "系统驱动"},
{"The system's driver from the next start on. Restart BOTWRecompAndroid to use it.",
 "从下次启动起使用系统驱动。重新启动 BOTWRecompAndroid 即可使用。"},
{"These options are for Turnip: the driver in use takes the safer paths anyway.",
 "这些选项是给 Turnip 用的：当前使用的驱动本来就走更稳妥的方式。"},
{"They aren't in BOTWRecompAndroid's data folder, so they were left alone.",
 "它们不在 BOTWRecompAndroid 的数据文件夹中，所以没有动它们。"},
{"This deletes BOTWRecompAndroid's copy of the game files (%.1f GB).",
 "这会删除 BOTWRecompAndroid 复制的游戏文件（%.1f GB）。"},
{"This GPU: %s",
 "此 GPU：%s"},
{"This only needs to be done once and may take a while.",
 "只需进行一次，可能需要一些时间。"},
{"Those files can't be used",
 "这些文件无法使用"},
{"Touch controls",
 "触屏操作"},
{"Translates the game's shaders with 32-bit address math, the path used for drivers without 64-bit integers (Adreno 6xx / 7xx and Mali stock drivers). Try it if lighting, grass or text are missing or wrong on your GPU. Applies to shaders translated from now on: restart the app for all of them.",
 "用 32 位地址运算转换游戏的着色器，这是没有 64 位整数的驱动所用的方式（Adreno 6xx / 7xx 和 Mali 原装驱动）。如果你的 GPU 上光照、草地或文字缺失或出错，可以试试。只对此后转换的着色器生效：重启应用即可全部生效。"},
{"Turn on Touch controls (Video tab) to edit the layout.",
 "请先开启触屏操作（视频标签页）再编辑布局。"},
{"Turnip low-resolution Z (LRZ)",
 "Turnip 低分辨率 Z（LRZ）"},
{"Turnip's early depth test, a little faster. Off can fix missing or broken drawing on some Adreno GPUs. Automatic: on for Adreno 8xx GPUs, off for the others. Applies when BOTWRecompAndroid restarts.",
 "Turnip 的提前深度测试，稍快一些。关闭可修复某些 Adreno GPU 上缺失或破损的画面。自动：Adreno 8xx GPU 上开启，其他关闭。在 BOTWRecompAndroid 重新启动后生效。"},
{"Unlocked",
 "自由"},
{"Unlocked (fill the screen)",
 "自由（填满屏幕）"},
{"Unlocked: the view fills the screen, so wider screens show more of Hyrule, and the HUD moves out to its edges (menus stay in the middle). Game version 1.8.2 (1.0.0 and 1.6.0 keep 16:9 with bars); a change applies when the game starts again (Quit -> Return to start, then Play). Original 16:9: the game's own framing, with bars.",
 "自由：画面填满屏幕，屏幕越宽能看到的海拉鲁越多，HUD 也会移到屏幕边缘（菜单保持在中间）。适用于游戏版本 1.8.2（1.0.0 和 1.6.0 保持带黑边的 16:9）；更改会在游戏重新开始时生效（退出 -> 回到开始界面，然后开始游戏）。原始 16:9：游戏本来的取景，带黑边。"},
{"Upscaler",
 "放大器"},
{"Use substitute font",
 "使用替代字体"},
{"Use the system driver",
 "使用系统驱动"},
{"Version",
 "版本"},
{"Versions 1.0.0, 1.6.0 and 1.8.2 can be set up side by side, each with its own saves.",
 "1.0.0、1.6.0 和 1.8.2 版本可以并排设置，各自有自己的存档。"},
{"Versions and setup",
 "版本与设置"},
{"Video",
 "视频"},
{"Volume",
 "音量"},
{"Vulkan driver",
 "Vulkan 驱动"},
{"Which version PLAY starts. Each one keeps its own game files, saves and settings; 1.6.0 and 1.8.2 start from a copy of 1.0.0's saves and settings. Choosing another one starts BOTWRecompAndroid again with it.",
 "“开始游戏”启动的版本。每个版本都有自己的游戏文件、存档和设置；1.6.0 和 1.8.2 从 1.0.0 的存档和设置的副本开始。选择其他版本会以该版本重新启动 BOTWRecompAndroid。"},
{"Working...",
 "处理中..."},
{"Writes what the app reports (GPU, driver, errors) to botwrecomp-log.txt in a folder you choose (create one, e.g. Download/BOTWRecomp), to open on the phone and send with a bug report. Turn it on and play until the problem shows; after a crash, the run before is kept as botwrecomp-log-previous.txt.",
 "把应用报告的内容（GPU、驱动、错误）写入你选择的文件夹中的 botwrecomp-log.txt（新建一个，例如 Download/BOTWRecomp），方便在手机上打开并随错误报告一起发送。开启后一直玩到问题出现；崩溃之后，上一次运行会保存为 botwrecomp-log-previous.txt。"},
{"Wrong game version (needs v1.0.0, v1.6.0 or v1.8.2)",
 "游戏版本不对（需要 v1.0.0、v1.6.0 或 v1.8.2）"},
{"Wrong version of the game",
 "游戏版本不对"},
{"Xbox button",
 "Xbox 按钮"},
{"Yes, delete them",
 "是，删除"},
{"You can change this any time in Settings.",
 "你可以随时在设置中更改。"},
{"You're on the start screen.",
 "你在开始界面。"},
{"Your copy of the game",
 "你的游戏副本"},
{"Camera by dragging",
 "拖动控制镜头"},
{"The camera turns while a finger moves on the right half of the screen and stops when it stops, as in phone shooters, instead of a stick held to one side.",
 "手指在屏幕右半边移动时镜头跟着转动，手指停下镜头也停下，就像手机射击游戏一样，不必把摇杆一直推向一边。"},
{"Drag sensitivity",
 "拖动灵敏度"},
{"Sticks only while touched",
 "仅在触摸时显示摇杆"},
{"The sticks are drawn only while a finger holds them, for a cleaner screen.",
 "只有手指按住时才绘制摇杆，让画面更干净。"},
{"Larger stick areas",
 "扩大摇杆区域"},
{"Each stick starts anywhere on its half of the screen, not only in the lower part. The buttons stay in front.",
 "每个摇杆可以从屏幕对应的半边任意位置开始，而不只是下方。按钮仍在最前面。"},
{"Flicker capture", "闪屏抓取"},
{"Start flicker capture", "开始闪屏抓取"},
{"Stop flicker capture", "停止闪屏抓取"},
{"Change threshold (%)", "变化阈值（%）"},
{"Saved events: %u  |  Skipped frames: %u", "已保存：%u 组  |  漏采：%u 帧"},
{"Saving the before / during / after images...", "正在保存变化前、变化时和变化后的图片…"},
{"Keeps three images in memory. Saves before, peak and after an abrupt change, with preview.png. Lower thresholds catch smaller changes and more normal motion.", "内存保留三张图，突变时保存变化前、最明显时和恢复或稳定后的画面，以及 preview.png 对照图。阈值越低越敏感，也越容易抓到正常镜头运动。"},
{"Could not save capture", "抓帧保存失败，请检查可用空间"},
{"Capture limit reached", "本次抓取已达到保存上限，已停止"},
{"Could not create capture directory", "无法创建抓取目录"},
{"Could not start capture writer", "无法启动抓帧保存线程"},
{"Capture format is unsupported", "当前画面格式不支持抓取"},
{"Could not allocate capture memory", "无法分配抓取内存"},
{"Flicker capture: %u saved", "GPU 抓帧 · 已保存 %u 组"},
{"Continuous capture", "持续抓帧"},
{"Stop continuous capture", "停止持续抓帧"},
{"Capture current frame", "抓取当前帧"},
{"Saving GPU capture...", "正在保存 GPU 抓帧…"},
{"Continuous capture keeps two complete GPU frames in memory and saves changes above the threshold, with preview.png. Capture current frame saves once. Full GPU capture slows the game while active.", "持续抓帧在内存保留两帧完整 GPU 数据，超过阈值才保存变化前、变化后及 preview.png。抓取当前帧只保存一次。完整抓帧开启时会降低游戏速度。"},
{"GPU capture library is unavailable", "完整 GPU 抓帧不可用"},
{"Could not finish GPU capture", "完整 GPU 抓帧失败"},
{"GPU capture memory limit reached", "两帧 GPU 数据超过 2 GiB，已停止抓取"},
{"Lightweight diagnostics", "轻量诊断抓帧"},
{"Full GPU replay capture", "完整 GPU 回放抓帧"},
{"Full replay capture is enabled at startup and can use several GiB.", "本次启动启用了完整回放抓帧，可能占用数 GiB。"},
{"Saves stage thumbnails, draw state, shader code and bounded uniform inputs with the before/after previews. Large resources are not copied. Omitted data is listed; this diagnostic bundle cannot replay a full GPU frame.", "保存阶段缩略图、绘制状态、着色器原码和有上限的常量输入，并附变化前后预览。不会复制全部大资源；省略内容会标明。此诊断包不能直接回放整帧。"},
{"Pause test", "暂停测试"},
{"Resume game", "继续游戏"},
{"Game graphics need preparing", "游戏图形需要预编译"},
{"Checking all game shaders...", "正在检查全部游戏着色器…"},
{"Reading graphics warm-up list...", "正在读取常用图形清单…"},
{"Preparing graphics used by the warm-up list...", "正在准备常用游戏图形…"},
{"Graphics warm-up complete.", "常用游戏图形准备完成。"},
{"Graphics will be prepared during play.", "图形将在游戏运行时准备。"},
{"Preparing game graphics...", "正在预编译游戏图形…"},
{"Game graphics ready.", "游戏图形准备完成。"},
{"Game graphics preparation failed", "游戏图形预编译未完成"},
{"Prepare graphics again after updating the app.", "更新应用后重新准备游戏图形。"},
{"Shader cache", "着色器缓存"},
{"Allow runtime shader compilation", "允许运行时编译回退"},
{"Missing or damaged cached shaders are compiled during play and saved. First use may cause a brief pause. Turn off to require complete graphics preparation before playing.", "游戏中遇到缺失或损坏的着色器缓存时，自动编译并保存，首次使用可能短暂卡顿。关闭后，需要完整准备游戏图形才能启动。"},
{"Uses the GPU's native single precision for double arithmetic. May cause visual errors. Turn off to use double precision emulation on the GPU. With runtime compilation disabled, prepare graphics again after changing this.", "使用 GPU 原生单精度执行双精度算术，可能产生画面误差。关闭后使用 GPU 双精度模拟；若已关闭运行时编译回退，更改精度后需要重新准备游戏图形。"},
